$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-31893/selection/ma-v1/d5feadaadbd2ac412d5391bfd70f15347c61756a02ae8d2dbb90e9c006aaf3b9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-1/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" :answer/id #uuid "23aadfeb-a12f-5d04-8b68-8a411f75a314" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "cae55a35-a19f-521b-bcd4-5925d2ba7970" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275758/field-1/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261" :answer-field/choices ["q-275758/field-1/09f9568b9032a258744b73b08553a45679ce3baf10e1847349ddb9cf78a3d261"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-2/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "2685e309-bf99-590c-82a6-a1618faa329f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "33ded688-a456-57c1-bd1b-2b0d24950199" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275758/field-2/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-275758/field-2/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-3/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "1450bd91-6e46-5270-8f1e-81be3169bc11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "85e7cf31-5e64-5d90-8440-bdf300bd09ca" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275758/field-3/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-275758/field-3/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275758" :question/id #uuid "9197a66d-6982-5b0a-b6b2-5e26098bb7cf" :question/math-academy-id "q-275758" :question/problem "The solution to the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-4x+2y=-1 \\\\ x-3y=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n| $x=$ {{field-1}} |\n| --- |\n\n| |  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $-1$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $2$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | $-2$ |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $2$ |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{(-4)\\cdot (-3)-1\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275758/field-1" "q-275758/field-2" "q-275758/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c89778fa-3c8d-5f0a-a0f8-c9b3d9193ffd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-2